WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.173
The broadest split is categorical versus numeric
Categorical variables

00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:13.603
represent labels or ordered levels Nominal and
ordinal belong here Numeric

00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:20.460
variables represent quantities Interval and ratio
belong here Do

00:00:20.474 --> 00:00:25.983
not decide by looking only at the characters in the
column A ZIP code

00:00:26.009 --> 00:00:31.512
contains digits but is categorical A satisfaction
score uses numbers but

00:00:31.538 --> 00:00:33.788
usually represents ordered categories
